  "title": "The McL 6GT Does Something McLaren Never Does: Look Backwards",
  "summary": "Until now, McLaren has been an exclusively forward-looking company that brings the latest Formula One hypertech to the road with cars known for sporting lots of computers and wind-shaping airfoils behind their atomic-insect faces. But McLaren has real heritage, and the new McL 6GT concept is its first drivable attempt to directly mine its past […]",
